sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Employee
    participant Product as Mesa Tica
    Employee->>Product: Sign in and open staff queue
    alt Authorized employee
    Product-->>Employee: Active orders oldest first, last successful refresh time
    Employee->>Product: Choose status filter
    Product-->>Employee: Matching orders
    loop While queue open and access valid
    Product-->>Employee: Automatically show matching new orders/status changes, preserve filter
    end
    alt Updates fail
    Product-->>Employee: Keep last information/time, show stale warning
    else Updates recover
    Product-->>Employee: Current queue, clear stale warning
    end
    opt Access expires
    Product-->>Employee: Sign in again before viewing or changing staff data
    end
    else Access denied
    Product-->>Employee: Sign-in or access-denied guidance, no staff order data
    end
